WEBVTT

1
00:00:30.440 --> 00:00:38.440
♪♪

2
00:00:50.000 --> 00:00:52.765
DEREK: Say hello
to ldiosa Dartellum 7,

3
00:00:52.920 --> 00:00:55.127
or the ID-7 virus.

4
00:00:55.320 --> 00:00:58.767
Nasty-looking
little fucker, huh?

5
00:00:58.920 --> 00:01:00.410
For the uninitiated,

6
00:01:00.560 --> 00:01:03.723
the ID-7 strain makes
stress hormone levels rise,

7
00:01:03.880 --> 00:01:06.486
blocks neural paths,
essentially attacking our id

8
00:01:06.640 --> 00:01:08.563
and throwing off
a very important balance

9
00:01:08.720 --> 00:01:11.371
in our brains...

10
00:01:11.520 --> 00:01:13.921
the balance between
emotions and reason

11
00:01:14.080 --> 00:01:16.242
that keep us
from doing stupid shit,

12
00:01:16.400 --> 00:01:19.165
thinks like punching
your boss in the face when angry

13
00:01:19.320 --> 00:01:21.687
or fucking your date
in public when horny.

14
00:01:21.840 --> 00:01:23.683
That balance
is temporarily severed,

15
00:01:23.840 --> 00:01:25.251
causing inhibitions to drop

16
00:01:25.400 --> 00:01:27.528
and basic instincts
to rise to the surface

17
00:01:27.680 --> 00:01:28.920
as the infected fall victim

18
00:01:29.080 --> 00:01:32.209
to what experts call
emotional hijacking.

19
00:01:32.400 --> 00:01:35.006
Social media has tagged it
the red-eye virus

20
00:01:35.160 --> 00:01:37.049
for obvious reasons.

21
00:01:37.240 --> 00:01:44.931
♪♪

22
00:01:45.120 --> 00:01:47.043
So in a nutshell,

23
00:01:47.200 --> 00:01:50.090
basic human dignity
takes a sick leave.

24
00:01:50.240 --> 00:01:52.083
The first reported case
of the red-eye virus

25
00:01:52.240 --> 00:01:54.561
occurred 18 months ago
in Des Moines, Iowa,

26
00:01:54.720 --> 00:01:56.404
and quickly spread
around the world.

27
00:01:56.560 --> 00:01:59.211
Since then, there have been
over 1,000 confirmed outbreaks

28
00:01:59.360 --> 00:02:01.044
reported globally,
over half of which

29
00:02:01.200 --> 00:02:02.884
are in the United States alone.

30
00:02:03.040 --> 00:02:05.691
The CDC is optimistic they can
contain the virus immediately

31
00:02:05.840 --> 00:02:07.285
through mandated quarantines,

32
00:02:07.480 --> 00:02:08.561
and the nation
will be virus-free

33
00:02:08.720 --> 00:02:10.051
by the end of the year

34
00:02:10.200 --> 00:02:11.884
as antibodies are being
aggressively tested.

35
00:02:12.040 --> 00:02:13.883
They also state the virus
isn't lethal,

36
00:02:14.040 --> 00:02:16.042
which is technically true.

37
00:02:16.200 --> 00:02:21.206
But while the virus can't kill,
the infected, or redders, can.

38
00:02:21.360 --> 00:02:23.362
♪♪

39
00:02:23.520 --> 00:02:25.409
Introducing Mr. Nevil Reed,

40
00:02:25.560 --> 00:02:28.325
the first redder to be
officially cleared for murder.

41
00:02:28.480 --> 00:02:29.845
♪♪

42
00:02:30.040 --> 00:02:31.326
