44
00:02:39.480 --> 00:02:40.891
DEREK: His legal defense alleged

45
00:02:41.040 --> 00:02:42.929
that those infected
with the ID-7 strain

46
00:02:43.080 --> 00:02:44.650
can't control their emotions

47
00:02:44.800 --> 00:02:46.928
